A free subdomain provided by Scaleway for your hosting.

USAGE:
  scw webhosting freedomain <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  check-availability Check whether a given slug and free domain combination is available.
  list               Retrieve the list of free root domains available for a Web Hosting.

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for freedomain
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use

Use "scw webhosting freedomain [command] --help" for more information about a command.
